</div><div class="bt_bb_separator bt_bb_border_style_none bt_bb_bottom_spacing_60" data-bt-override-class="null"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bt_bb_row  bt_bb_column_gap_15" style="; --column-gap:15px;" data-bt-override-class="{}"id="experiencia"><div class="bt_bb_row_holder" ><div  class="bt_bb_column col-xxl-4 col-xl-4 bt_bb_vertical_align_top bt_bb_align_left bt_bb_padding_normal" style="; --column-width:4;" data-width="4" data-bt-override-class="{}"><div class="bt_bb_column_content"><div class="bt_bb_column_content_inner"><div id="precio" class="bt_bb_price_list bt_bb_color_scheme_5" style="z-index:5;; --price-list-primary-color:#000000; --price-list-secondary-color:#fa830f;"><div class="bt_bb_price_list_image"><div class="bt_bb_image" data-bt-override-class="null"><a href="https://impermeabilizanteskarisa.mx/portfolio/nave-industrial-samsung-tijuana/"  target="_self" title="Samsung Tijuana"><img decoding="async" src="https://impermeabilizanteskarisa.mx/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/IMPER-SAMSUNG-2023_1.webp" data-full_image_src="https://impermeabilizanteskarisa.mx/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/IMPER-SAMSUNG-2023_1.webp"  title="Samsung Tijuana" alt="Samsung Tijuana"></a></div></div><div class="bt_bb_price_list_price"  style="z-index:5;; --price-list-primary-color:#000000; --price-list-secondary-color:#fa830f;"><span class="bt_bb_price_list_currency"></span><span class="bt_bb_price_list_amount">Industrial</span></div><div class="bt_bb_price_list_title">Samsung Tijuana</div><div class="bt_bb_price_list_subtitle"></div><ul><li>Impermeabilización en azotea de nave industrial con prefabricado 3.5 mm color rojo.</li></ul><div class="bt_bb_price_list_button"><div class="bt_bb_button bt_bb_color_scheme_5 bt_bb_style_underlined bt_bb_size_small bt_bb_align_inherit" style="; --primary-color:#000000; --secondary-color:#fa830f;" data-bt-override-class="{}"><a href="https://impermeabilizanteskarisa.mx/portfolio/nave-industrial-samsung-tijuana/" target="_self" c